<mxCell id="c59" value="Lookup requires both phone and order code. Normalize 0/+84 phone numbers and compare order codes case-insensitively. /orders/track is read-only; the separate GHN tracking GET may persist evidence without changing Order.status.&#xa;Carrier metadata is stored in Order.rawPayload; this path has no separate Shipment entity. A GHN adapter exists; no equivalent automatic GHTK integration was found in the reviewed modules.&#xa;The timeline switch has no dedicated RETURN_REQUESTED/DISPUTED case. The page can open a review modal for DELIVERED, although the review service and backend require COMPLETED." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1296" width="1960" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
