<mxCell id="c84" value="The authenticated Customer path uses JWT. It requires a COMPLETED order, no returnRequest, a product in that order, and no existing review. Images are optional. New reviews are PENDING/isApproved=false until Shop/Admin moderation.&#xa;The public path supports images up to 5MB, videos up to 50MB and HMAC verification. Its submit contract is inconsistent with the backend; see sequence FR-18B. It is not the same endpoint as authenticated Customer reviews.&#xa;ProductReview.reviewedBy is a scalar UUID. The Customer service checks duplicates before create; the database unique constraint is the final safeguard. No explicit transaction or row lock is present in createVerifiedReview." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1726" width="1960" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
