<mxCell id="c59" value="OrdersService calls OrderWebhookNormalizerService.normalize. ORDER_WEBHOOK_SECRETS maps storeId:source to a timing-safe shared secret. This is not JWT authentication or automatic marketplace OAuth.&#xa;Idempotency uses unique(storeId, sourcePlatform, externalOrderSn). A duplicate without a timestamp is unchanged. Only a newer eventAt may update status under a row lock and transition validation; backward transitions are rejected.&#xa;The transaction creates Order and OrderItems with zero commission placeholders. Webhook intake does not decrement stock, credit wallets or create commissions. It does not infer attributedCollaboratorId." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1246" width="1960" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
