<mxCell id="c59" value="Shop/Admin/Manager must pass JWT, RolesGuard and resolveManagedStore. The backend validates recipient details, SKU, quantities, prices and totals. A Shop cannot create orders for another Shop.&#xa;Excel import is not one transaction for the whole file. Failed orders produce row-level errors while other valid orders may commit. No ImportJob/ImportBatch entity is created.&#xa;Manual/import paths reconcile orders: they lock and check quantities but do not reserve/decrement stock or create GHN shipments, quotes, commissions or wallet credits. Manual shippingFee is an input, not a dynamic checkout quote.&#xa;requestId replay is supported only without a custom externalOrderSn; a different fingerprint returns 409. Manual/webhook intake does not assign attributedCollaboratorId, so FR-21 requires valid attribution from another path." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1305" width="1960" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
