<mxCell id="c63" value="The calculator preserves existing commission snapshots rather than applying current prices or tiers to historical orders. Without a snapshot, it uses base 10% + tier 0-3%, allocates discount/refund effects and rounds item&#xa;commissions to two decimals.&#xa;Creation requires a DELIVERED/COMPLETED order, an active attributed KOL and no existing commission. eligibleAt uses completedAt ?? updatedAt, not createdAt. availableAt counts 14 days excluding configured holidays.&#xa;Cron runs reversal, creation, then approval, up to 100 candidates per stage. DISABLE_SCHEDULED_JOBS=true skips execution. Approval is not a KOL-triggered endpoint.&#xa;Clawback removes PENDING commissions from pending funds and APPROVED commissions from available funds, potentially creating recoverable debt. RETURN_REQUESTED/DISPUTED are not approved or reversed; CANCELLED/RETURNED trigger&#xa;reversal." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1701" width="1960" height="172" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
