<mxCell id="c67" value="The server takes collaboratorId from JWT and requires an active COLLABORATOR, VERIFIED KYC and complete bank details. Only funds allocated to the selected Shop can be withdrawn. Insufficient Shop funds roll back even if the global&#xa;balance is sufficient.&#xa;Gross is debited once when the request is created. Tax is withheld within gross, not charged again. Approval does not debit again. Any debit/ledger/payout failure rolls back the transaction.&#xa;Row locks prevent concurrent over-withdrawal, but do not make two valid submissions idempotent. The UI has an in-flight guard; the withdrawal backend has no separate requestId/idempotencyKey." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1685" width="1960" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
