<mxCell id="c66" value="Example: gross 1,999,999 -&gt; tax 0; gross 2,000,000 -&gt; tax 200,000 and net 1,800,000. The threshold applies per request, not cumulatively per month. This is the project's FR-23 rule.&#xa;The service and database triggers enforce append-only behavior for UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE. Corrections use new entries, never edits to existing rows. This is not a mandatory double-entry accounting system: escrow release writes two&#xa;balance-bucket entries; withdrawal writes one negative gross entry.&#xa;All writes use the caller's Prisma transaction client. Invariant, uniqueness or trigger failures roll back balances and payout creation together. No REST endpoint edits the ledger." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1701" width="1960" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
