<mxCell id="c66" value="private storage" style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;text;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=center;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1295" y="844.75" width="110" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c67" value="The current web uses POST approval: a bill is required; the FE accepts PNG/JPG/PDF &lt;=5MB and the BE also accepts WEBP. note and bankRefCode are optional. The legacy scoped PATCH approval route still requires bankRefCode.&#xa;Approval requires PENDING/PROCESSING, a matching funded debit ledger and valid tax/net snapshots. It records APPROVED + AuditLog without another wallet debit or bank transfer API call. Private bill hashes and bank references&#xa;prevent reuse. Upload precedes the transaction; unlinked uploads are cleaned up on failure.&#xa;Export locks 1-200 PENDING payouts without a batch, validates funding, generates an XLSX using net amounts, persists the bytes and PayoutBatch, and marks payouts PROCESSING. It is a reconciliation workbook with VietQR Quick Links,&#xa;not a transfer API or universal bank import format.&#xa;Rejection is allowed only for PENDING requests not in a batch. One transaction refunds gross to the correct global/Shop wallets, appends PAYOUT_REJECT_REFUND and records REJECTED + audit. PROCESSING requests need reconciliation,&#xa;not automatic refunds." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1660" width="1960" height="196" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
