<mxCell id="c70" value="Additional foreign keys are listed in attributes: Order.customer/attributedCollaborator, ProductReview.order/product, StoreWallet.store, PayoutRequest.collaborator/store/approvedBy, and PayoutBatch.store/createdBy. ProductReview.reviewedBy is a scalar UUID, not a Prisma&#xa;User relation.&#xa;FinancialLedger has Wallet and Store foreign keys, not a StoreWallet foreign key. Reconcile StoreWallet by walletId + storeId. referenceId is a polymorphic business reference to Commission/PayoutRequest, not a database foreign key.&#xa;Commission.PAID exists in the schema, but the payout approval path shown here does not set it. A withdrawal is not a one-to-one commission payment. DTO validation enforces ratings from 1 to 5." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1850" width="2300" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
